    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash the Cache is a lighthearted roguelite. Steal everything you can! Escape, buy upgrades, and steal again, but this time, more! How far can you take it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good ole fun ;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is stealable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around the map and choose any house based on its level. Procedural generation allows you to explore and loot new houses again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the store after you loot to buy more upgrades and become better thief.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash the Cache is a lighthearted roguelite. Steal everything you can! Escape, buy upgrades, and steal again, but this time, more! How far can you take it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good ole fun ;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is stealable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around the map and choose any house based on its level. Procedural generation allows you to explore and loot new houses again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the store after you loot to buy more upgrades and become better thief.</p>",
    "short_description": "Cash the Cache is a lighthearted roguelite heist-\u2019em-up. Break into procedurally generated homes, grab all the loot you can carry, tackle skill-based minigames for bonuses, then make a daring getaway\u2014upgrade your gear and pull off even bigger scores in your next run. How much will you dare to steal?",
